    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A charming 4 bedroom semi-detached cottage tastefully finished & beautifully presented accommodation throughout. ‘’Rose Cottage’’ is very well proportioned and has an abundance of natural light flowing through the home, whilst also offering beautifully landscaped gardens with views across the adjacent countryside. Briefly, this is a quality home in a prime family location within easy access of Bettystown village and just 5 minutes from national and secondary schools, shops and supermarkets. It is also close to a range of leisure amenities, Beaches and Laytown & Bettystown Golf & Tennis Club. Drogheda Town Centre is a 10 minute drive, Laytown Train Station is within a 3 minute drive, with access to the M1 Motorway only 10 minutes away. Viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate this property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway\r\nLiving Room\t\t(4.80m x 5.15m)\r\nKitchen\t / Dining\t(4.82m x 5.43m)\r\nUtility Room\t\t(1.71m x 1.69m)\r\nBedroom 1\t\t(3.72m x 3.00m)\r\nBedroom 2\t\t(2.95m x 2.71m)\r\nBedroom 3\t\t(3.13m x 2.35m)\r\nBedroom 4\t\t(2.32m x 3.02m)\r\nMain Bathroom \t(2.71m x 2.04m)"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "4 Bedroom Semi-Detached Cottage\r\nBuilt C. 1911\r\nExtends to c. 114 sq.m. (c. 1,227 sq.ft.)\r\nExtended To The Rear\r\nLarge Vehicular Side Access\r\nUpgraded Attic & Wall Insulation\r\nMains Water Softener\r\nO-F-C-H \r\nMulti Fuel Stove\r\nDouble Glazing Throughout\r\nWater – Mains Water\r\nWaste – Septic Tank\r\nMature Gardens & Planting\r\nNorth-East Facing Rear Orientation\r\nPrivate Surrounding Aspect\r\nWooden Garden Shed\r\nPaved Patio Seating Area\r\nElectric Sliding Security Gate \r\nAmple Off Street Parking"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
